%% Queue session lifecycle (queue_sessions.status)
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> SCHEDULED: create (date today..+30)
  SCHEDULED --> OPEN: open (on session date)
  SCHEDULED --> CLOSED: close
  OPEN --> CLOSED: close (force if active entries) /<br/>nightly auto-close
  CLOSED --> [*]
  note right of SCHEDULED: bookings allowed, no calls
  note right of OPEN: bookings and calls allowed
